analytics (1.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix bounce rate permanently inflated (read session before upsert)
  * Fix page_stats.avg_engagement off-by-one formula
  * Fix page_stats.sessions inflation on page revisit
  * Add SQLite busy_timeout(5000) to reduce SQLITE_BUSY errors
  * Run retention job immediately on startup (not after 24h delay)
  * Add rate limiting to dashboard API endpoints
  * Remove ?api_key= from dashboard auth (header only)
  * Fix parseIP mangling bare IPv6 addresses
  * Add Vary: Origin to CORS responses
  * Narrow isBusyError matching (remove overly broad "(5)" pattern)
  * Add retry jitter to StoreEvents backoff
  * Fix config.Load() to handle -h/--help and parse errors
  * Return 0 count on StoreEvents error (not partially-inserted count)
  * Fix tracker: reset engagement/scroll on SPA pageview()
  * Fix tracker: dispose() now flushes before marking disposed
  * Remove ExecReload (server doesn't handle SIGHUP)
  * Dockerfile: multi-arch build, CGO_ENABLED=0, includes dashboard SPA
  * Release workflow: fix changelog version substitution
  * Delete dead schema.sql, clean up dashboard dead code/imports
  * Add debian/copyright, fix inert logrotate config
  * Fix Makefile install path (/usr/local/bin → /usr/bin)

